        "created_at": "2014-12-17T13:46:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ronway, I made a note about that not necessarily being true up top.<br>\"<span>Wednesday- Intestinal Frolics (Infernal Relics) video:&nbsp;</span><a href=\"http://youtu.be/jlaA3MCQS4Y\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">http://youtu.be/jlaA3MCQS4Y</a><span>&nbsp;(Corrections, Apostate didn't rip Fanatic's wing off. I just envisioned that as he throw her to the ground, crumpled with doubt and fear, he tore her wing off to add insult to injury. He didn't and I apologize for inserting my own take on some of these interactions to these videos.)\"</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
