        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-12-17T21:02:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just watched the Infernal Relics vid. You pronounce \"Akash'Bhuta\" very differently to me (I say \"ak-ash BOO-tah\", for the record ;)), as well as various names of members of the Ennead...I suppose that's one thing about games where everything about them is text-based (including dicussions about them). Now I'm wondering how people pronounce various other names that aren't immediately obvious :D.</p><p>It's always cool to hear different people's views on the various decks and stuff. Will be interested to see your future vids :).</p>",
